            <h2>Inclusive Education: A Path to Combat Discriminatio</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="row g-4 align-items-center ">
            <div class="col-sm-12">
              <p class="h6 mb-3">By: Meenu Ratnani - Program Director, School of Inclusion</p>
              <p class="h6">New Delhi | February 29, 2024</p>
            </div>
          </div>
